// Installing a package (-run): installPackage() hands each part to the
// ROM's own InstallPart, which catches an error in a part, reports it through
// GetRoot():Notify with its message (the exception itself isn't printed, as
// on a Newton; with -dap the debugger stops at the throw), and still
// installs the other parts.
{name: "Two Parts", part: [
  {type: "form", data: {app: 'one, InstallScript: func(p) Throw('|evt.ex.msg|, "part one fails")}},
  {type: "auto", data: {InstallScript: func(p) Print("part two installed")}}]}
